  "description": "Intelligent HTTP response caching for Reliable.HttpClient with preset-based\n      configuration, automatic memory management, and zero-setup convenience methods.",
  "id": "Reliable.HttpClient.Caching",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-08-29T15:26:00.063Z",
